assessment.verification_assessment:
Acceptance is observable and mechanical. AC-01 maps to named probes:
- byte-equal canonical documents from predecessor and successors;
- MISMATCH producing a nonzero exit;
- conversation isolation;
- order independence;
- derivation of actions via the lifecycle rule;
- SEEN is not treated as RESOLVED;
- typed holds for seven failure classes.
Each probe is backed by discriminating controls with an intact/fault/restored pattern and application_count 1, plus full regression and architecture checks. The evidence schema is pinned. One independent verifier verdict (JC, fresh worktree, exact SHA) is meaningful because all probes share one predicate, reconstruction equivalence plus hold behaviour. The labelled substitutions (LOCAL_PROCESS_BOUNDARY_SUBSTITUTE_FOR_EPISODE and LABELLED_DERIVATION_RULE_v1) must be visible to the verifier. The local PASS is explicitly not operational acceptance.
